  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up Investment in Weather and Climate Information Services (WCIS2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the WCIS 2 Activity is to enhance resilience, productivity, and nutritional outcomes in fishing and agriculture systems (i.e., farming, livestock, pastoralism), and expand the use of products and services in the face of increased climate uncertainty and weather hazards through scaling up investment in the weather and climate information services (WCIS) value chain.</narrative>
  </description>
